  "solution": "**Concept used:**\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8fde884dec2270c5fbf23b40fa3fd73f502b69b8fe56ab103fc87bfde045e59b.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n 36(2)/(5) ÷ [27 + (3)/(8) of 24 + (45 ÷ 9 - 4(3)/(5))]\n\n⇒ (182)/(5) ÷ [27 + (3)/(8) × 24 + (45 ÷ 9 - (23)/(5))]\n\n⇒ (182)/(5) ÷ [27 + 3 × 3 + (5 - (23)/(5))]\n\n⇒ (182)/(5) ÷ [27 + 9 + 2/5]\n\n⇒ (182)/(5) ÷ [182/5]\n\n⇒ (182)/(5) × (5)/(182) \n\n⇒ 1\n\n**So, the value is 1**\n\n202",
